<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 90,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 90,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's actual receipts 90,000 head at interior Iowa/Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $1.00 higher compared with mid-session Wednesday. Top $57.50 per cwt.</p>
